From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:56:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] arcana: 0043-keyword-cant-have

RemoveKeywordEffect / Modification.RemoveKeyword gain cantHave: for the
effect's duration the object can't have the keyword at all. The projector
strips forbidden keywords after all of Layer 6 (and after keyword-counter
re-application), so later-timestamped grants, static abilities and counters
don't restore it. removeKeywordFromAll(..., cantHave = true) for groups.
Arcane Lighthouse: 'creatures your opponents control lose hexproof and
shroud and can't have hexproof or shroud' (rulings 2014-11-07).
